00:21:35.930 --> 00:21:38.960
You're such a tsundere.

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:41.310
A tsundere? What's that?

00:21:41.310 --> 00:21:43.650
And you're an airhead, too.

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:46.240
What's with the skit?

00:21:47.290 --> 00:21:48.320
A skit?

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:50.450
The tea is ready.

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:54.250
Watch out!

00:21:57.800 --> 00:21:58.820
We managed not to break anything.

00:21:58.820 --> 00:22:00.840
Huggy!

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:03.620
Are you all right? Huggy!

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:05.130
I'm sorry.

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:06.590
<i>A klutz...</i>

00:22:06.790 --> 00:22:08.090
<i>And a nice follow-up.</i>

00:22:09.520 --> 00:22:13.330
Maki, when can we be sure the students 
are listening to the school broadcast?

00:22:13.330 --> 00:22:14.240
What?

00:22:14.240 --> 00:22:17.820
During lunch, I would think.

00:22:18.050 --> 00:22:18.980
That's it.

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:22.150
